  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dumisha Afya Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity&apos;s purpose is to increase the use of quality county-led health and social services in select counties in Kenya. This is a service delivery project at the county level, providing HIV care and treatment; services to orphans and vulnerable children (OVC) and adolescents; and services in the areas of family planning/reproductive, maternal, newborn, child and adolescent health (FP/RMNCAH), nutrition, and water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH).</narrative>
  </description>
